Upstream-bound: yes
Subject: [match-neutral] DrawCallback.arg is void* (LP64-safe)

Layer draw callbacks pass actor/task pointers through DrawCallback.arg.
Storing that as s32 truncates high bits on host LP64 and SEGVs in
FIELDSTG_drawActor (and any other sorted/plain draw callback). On ILP32
void* and s32 are the same width, so layout stays match-neutral.

